WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.201
-Look how beautiful
you look here

00:00:02.201 --> 00:00:03.202
on the cover of "Elle"
right there.

00:00:03.202 --> 00:00:05.671
Not bad.

00:00:05.671 --> 00:00:07.140
Do you like doing --

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:10.243
Do you like doing the big photo
shoots and the covers and --

00:00:10.243 --> 00:00:12.278
-Yeah, I mean,
I think it's always --

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:15.481
I'm always super grateful
to work with amazing people,

00:00:15.481 --> 00:00:16.949
work with a magazine
like "Elle."

00:00:16.949 --> 00:00:20.387
Obviously it's
a super-iconic magazine.

00:00:20.387 --> 00:00:21.720
-Yeah.

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:24.089
-This shoot in particular
was really cool and really fun

00:00:24.089 --> 00:00:27.059
'cause I got to work with
a lot of amazing women.

00:00:27.059 --> 00:00:29.895
The stylist was a female.
The photographer was a female.

00:00:29.895 --> 00:00:31.798
People that I've worked with
in the past

00:00:31.798 --> 00:00:33.666
that I'm comfortable with,
that I know.

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:35.701
So it was a great time.
It was a great crew.

00:00:35.701 --> 00:00:37.836
-It's fun.
Did you do any party tricks?

00:00:37.836 --> 00:00:39.171
Do you know what
I'm talking about?

00:00:39.171 --> 00:00:41.007
Well, I say this because
last time you were on our show,

00:00:41.007 --> 00:00:43.242
you did something that was
the most amazing thing ever.

00:00:43.242 --> 00:00:44.777
Everybody was talking about it.

00:00:44.777 --> 00:00:46.779
You opened a beer bottle
with your teeth.

00:00:46.779 --> 00:00:47.646
-Mm-hmm.

00:00:47.646 --> 00:00:49.615
-It was the raddest thing ever.

00:00:49.615 --> 00:00:51.851
Everyone was like -- You got
a double standing ovation.

00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:54.454
It was really amazing.
-It was really fun.

00:00:54.454 --> 00:00:57.290
And there's actually another
funny story behind this,

00:00:57.290 --> 00:00:59.592
and that is
that last time I was here,

00:00:59.592 --> 00:01:01.327
we did this little party trick

00:01:01.327 --> 00:01:03.996
where I opened a Corona bottle
with my teeth.

00:01:03.996 --> 00:01:08.401
And the next morning,
after the interview had aired,

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:12.371
I got a certain phone call
from a certain someone.

00:01:12.371 --> 00:01:15.207
And it was a little like,
"Hey, how are you?

00:01:15.207 --> 00:01:17.076
I saw you on 'Jimmy Fallon'
last night.

00:01:17.076 --> 00:01:18.378
You were looking really good.

00:01:18.378 --> 00:01:19.746
I loved that trick that you did.

00:01:19.746 --> 00:01:21.114
I had no idea
that you can do that.

00:01:21.114 --> 00:01:22.415
It was so cool."

00:01:22.415 --> 00:01:26.352
Cut to I'm now married
to that certain someone.

00:01:26.352 --> 00:01:28.421
-No. No!

00:01:28.421 --> 00:01:29.455
-Yes.
-Is that right?

00:01:29.455 --> 00:01:31.991
-So I feel like --
-Wait a sec.

00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:33.092
What?

00:01:33.092 --> 00:01:35.027
-I feel like Jimmy
gets a little credit

00:01:35.027 --> 00:01:36.462
for helping re-spark romance.

00:01:36.462 --> 00:01:39.098
-Thank you very much.

00:01:39.098 --> 00:01:42.034
-Alright, yep. That is true.
That is true.

00:01:42.034 --> 00:01:44.971
-You think I'd be invited
to the wedding.

00:01:44.971 --> 00:01:46.672
Now, look, now --
Hey, now, now --

00:01:46.672 --> 00:01:48.608
No, I'm joking.
I'm joking.

00:01:48.608 --> 00:01:51.577
By the way, I know, 'cause I've
seen you with Justin many times.

00:01:51.577 --> 00:01:53.579
And you guys
are so cute together.

00:01:53.579 --> 00:01:56.615
Look at how gorgeous.
This is you on your wedding day.

00:01:56.615 --> 00:02:00.018
Ooh la la.
[ Speaks French ]

00:02:00.018 --> 00:02:02.422
Here's you and Justin.

00:02:02.422 --> 00:02:04.390
Everyone gets to lick the groom.

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:05.558
Everyone --

00:02:05.558 --> 00:02:08.060
-Well, not everyone
got to lick the groom.

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:09.995
-Not everyone.
I'm sorry. No.

00:02:09.995 --> 00:02:12.431
It's so cool
to see you guys together,

00:02:12.431 --> 00:02:15.368
and you really are magic
together, I got to say.

00:02:15.368 --> 00:02:17.370
It's so fun to hang out
with you guys.

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:19.705
And I know I just saw you
when we did the hockey thing

00:02:19.705 --> 00:02:21.407
with Justin.
-Yeah, which was very funny.

00:02:21.407 --> 00:02:23.643
-Tell him thanks again for that.
He was great.

00:02:23.643 --> 00:02:27.714
But there's a really cool, odd
history between you and Justin

00:02:27.714 --> 00:02:29.448
that is almost unbelievable.

00:02:29.448 --> 00:02:31.550
This is out of a movie,
but it's real life.

00:02:31.550 --> 00:02:34.820
-Right.
-You met him back in 2009

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:38.157
when you were 13 years old
with your dad.

00:02:38.157 --> 00:02:39.892
What went down?
How'd it happen?

00:02:39.892 --> 00:02:43.062
-I know. Sounds like this weird
arranged-marriage situation.

00:02:43.062 --> 00:02:44.497
-I know, yeah.

00:02:44.497 --> 00:02:48.001
-We met because my dad, he
brought me to the "Today" show

00:02:48.001 --> 00:02:49.569
when Justin performed there.

00:02:49.569 --> 00:02:52.672
He was no more than 15, I think.

00:02:52.672 --> 00:02:55.575
And when we were there --
-Were you a Belieber?

00:02:55.575 --> 00:02:58.511
-To be honest --
this is the truth --

00:02:58.511 --> 00:03:02.948
he was so new that I didn't
really know a lot about him yet.

00:03:02.948 --> 00:03:05.851
-Yeah, that's right, the
"Today" show did have him
before he, like, blew up.

00:03:05.851 --> 00:03:07.887
-Yeah, it was really
kind of before anything.

00:03:07.887 --> 00:03:11.590
So I met him,
and his mom and my dad

00:03:11.590 --> 00:03:14.159
kind of just connected
as friends,

00:03:14.159 --> 00:03:16.395
and we invited them over
to our house the next day.

00:03:16.395 --> 00:03:19.331
So him and his mom just
came over for family dinner

00:03:19.331 --> 00:03:20.633
with me and my family.

00:03:20.633 --> 00:03:22.802
-Look at this.
-And we went bowling.

00:03:22.802 --> 00:03:25.171
That's me, yeah.

00:03:25.171 --> 00:03:28.507
And what's funny is that in
this photo, I'm super awkward.

00:03:28.507 --> 00:03:29.809
I had braces.

00:03:29.809 --> 00:03:33.412
Like, nowhere was there
a thought that I was like,

00:03:33.412 --> 00:03:35.014
"Yeah, he probably
has a crush on me."

00:03:35.014 --> 00:03:37.983
Like, I did not --
That was not the case at all.

00:03:37.983 --> 00:03:39.852
We were just -- I don't know --
just were hanging.

00:03:39.852 --> 00:03:42.055
-And you're married now.
-That is my entire husband.

00:03:42.055 --> 00:03:43.656
-Isn't that
the coolest story ever?

00:03:43.656 --> 00:03:47.460
I love this. How cute.
You're so cute. Come on.

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:48.595
-It's ridiculous.

